   1879  fc78							; IsRoomDark — Z=1 if lit, Z=0 if dark (RoomDarkMask = 8-bit split:
   1880  fc78							; rooms 0-3 = EnemyRamD bits 4-7, rooms 4-7 = LaserState bits 2-5.
   1881  fc78							; Rooms 8+ have no bit → always lit, never crash.)
   1882  fc78							; Clobbers A/X; Y preserved. PLA in ReturnPad re-sets Z from A — contract
   1883  fc78							; survives the cross-bank return.
